---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service | Peerly">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-heading-48 text-gray-1000 mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-copy-18 text-gray-400">
        Rules and guidelines for maintaining a supportive campus community.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="dashboard-card rounded-lg border border-[#374151] bg-[#1F2937] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-heading-24 text-gray-1000 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="inline-block h-8 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-tertiary)]"></span>
          1. Safe Space Commitment
        </h2>
        <p class="text-copy-16 text-gray-300">
          Peerly is a safe, anonymous peer support network for students. You agree to use the
          platform in good faith to discuss mental health, academic transitions, homesickness, and
          stress. Harassment, hate speech, bullying, or attempts to deanonymize other students will
          result in immediate ban and administrative action.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="dashboard-card rounded-lg border border-[#374151] bg-[#1F2937] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-heading-24 text-gray-1000 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="inline-block h-8 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-tertiary)]"></span>
          2. Verified Mentors
        </h2>
        <p class="text-copy-16 text-gray-300">
          Peer mentors are student leaders trained to provide support. They are not licensed
          clinicians. If you need professional, clinical, or immediate crisis therapy, please visit
          the Counseling Center resources page or contact campus security.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="dashboard-card rounded-lg border border-[#374151] bg-[#1F2937] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-heading-24 text-gray-1000 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="inline-block h-8 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-tertiary)]"></span>
          3. Platform Stewardship
        </h2>
        <p class="text-copy-16 text-gray-300">
          Users are responsible for the content of their discussions, replies, and messages. Peerly
          administrators reserve the right to remove any post, reply, or meeting that violates
          safety guidelines, or deactivate accounts as necessary to protect the community.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="text-button-14 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded border border-gray-200 px-6 py-3 font-bold transition-all hover:bg-gray-100"
      >
        Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
